+Implement `applyPatch(document, patch)` in `src/index.ts` (RFC 6902): operations add, remove, replace,
+move, copy and test. It returns a new document without mutating its input, and throws on an invalid
+patch or a failing operation. Tests in `src/index.test.ts`.
